{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21304","headline":"酬乐天见忆兼伤仲远 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天见忆兼伤仲远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"死别重泉閟，生离万里赊。\n瘴侵新病骨，梦到故人家。\n遥泪陈根草，闲收落地花。\n庾公楼怅望，巴子国生涯。\n河任天然曲，江随峡势斜。\n与君皆直戆，须分老泥沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}